====Definitions====
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# {{lb|zh|Classical}} [[not]] [[correctly]]; [[not]] [[exactly]]; [[not]] [[quite]]
# [[not]] ... it/them
#* {{zh-x|一 簞 食{sì}，一 豆 羹，得 之 則 生，弗 得 則 死 。|Here are a small basket of rice and a platter of soup; getting them will enable survival, while '''not''' getting them will result in death.|ref=Mengzi}}
