From {{inh|zh|sit-pro|*hwak||below}} (STEDT). Cognate with {{cog|bo|འོག||below}}, {{cog|my|အောက်||under; below}} (from {{cog|tbq-lob-pro|*ʔok|t=lower side; below}}).

